WEBVTT

00:00:29.636 --> 00:00:31.752
dhe ngulen nga nje shkop,

00:00:31.752 --> 00:00:33.288
keshtu toka ku ata ngulen shkopin

00:00:33.288 --> 00:00:34.996
u be shtepia e tyre.

00:00:34.996 --> 00:00:37.366
Ne fund te asaj dite te pare,

00:00:37.366 --> 00:00:39.116
banoret e Oklahoma City

00:00:39.116 --> 00:00:43.022
nga 0 u bene 10.000,

00:00:43.022 --> 00:00:44.363
gje per te cilen departamenti yne i planifikimit

00:00:44.363 --> 00:00:48.283
vazhdon te paguaje edhe sot.

00:00:48.283 --> 00:00:50.780
Qytetaret u mblodhen ate dite

00:00:50.780 --> 00:00:53.032
dhe zgjodhen nje kryetar bashkie.

00:00:53.032 --> 00:00:54.839
Pastaj e qelluan.

00:00:54.839 --> 00:00:59.488
(te qeshura)

00:00:59.947 --> 00:01:02.430
Nuk me duket aq shume argetuese